          "caption": "This church, started in 1872 and completed in 1880, was designed by PJH Cuypers, the same man who designed Centraal Station.  I fire broke out in 1904 and the firefighters had the burning tower fall into Vondelpark to protect the rest of the church from buring.  The architect's son, JT, added the new tower.  It now houses offices.",
